Spec: Project/Dependencies

Purpose:
  Explicit dependency graph, separate from the workflow order (flows.sdd)
  and from the skill order (chains/*). Three distinct relations exist and
  must not be conflated:

  Dependency:  BE -> API -> FE
  Skill:       BE -> DDD -> Clean Code -> Security -> Test
  Workflow:    BE -> FE -> MD -> QA -> DO -> VERIFY

Graph:

  Payment
   depends -> User
   depends -> Course
   depends -> PaymentGateway (external, see integrations.sdd)

  Course
   depends -> User

  User
   depends -> (none)

Rule:
  No cycles allowed. If a change to module A requires a change to module B,
  and B already depends on A, this is a circular-dependency violation
  (architecture.sdd -> ExtractCheck) and MUST be raised, not implemented.
